          text To measure the impact of incorporating some on logged-out reader retention, a test for will be pushed to logged-out readers. With the Image Carousel feature, readers browse community-uploaded images, selected by editors as relevant to specific articles. The test starts on November 20. @171,2643,30,873
          link "community-requested features" https://www.mediawiki.org/wiki/Special:MyLanguage/Readers/Reader_Growth/Image_Browsing#November_2025:_Ideas_and_feedback @171,3528,30,41
