          text An experimental notice will be pushed to 0.5% of logged-out mobile readers who come to English Wikipedia from Google, asking them to add Wikipedia as a . The test is to see if this notice increases reader retention and encourages people who use Google Search to visit Wikipedia more often. It will run from October 15–29 and will be assessed for its impact on retention and referrals. @171,3633,30,1320
          link "Google Preferred Source" https://blog.google/products-and-platforms/products/search/preferred-sources/ @171,4965,30,61
