          text Updates for technical contributors @171,5837,30,81
          text Due to a long-standing bug, applications that use the client credentials flow to act on their owners’ behalf are treated as if they are logged out. This will be fixed for new applications registered on or after Monday, October 19. Some affected applications need to re-register. @171,5930,30,893
